  "notes": "q = 229. With theta primitive in GF(q^2) and N = 4(q+1), the set R of residues i mod N with theta^i + theta^(qi) = 1 is a relative difference set with parameters (q+1, 4, q, (q-1)/4); translate it to be fixed by multiplication by q and to contain 0, take the union with its shift by q+1, and split Z_N = Z_8 x Z_n: the elements with first coordinate 0, 1, 2, 3 give the four rows (two skew, two symmetric) as +1/-1 indicators on Z_n. The rows are stored in canonical form under equiv-v1."
